// Wave 2 piece N: Stun E2E demo. Caster stuns target for 1s.
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { effects: [EffectOp::Stun{duration_ticks:10}],
//                            chances: [Some(32768)] }.
// `chance 50%` exercises Wave 1.5#5 chance-modifier lowering — the
// q16 fixed-point chance value lands in program.chances and the .sim
// verb's `when` clause hand-mirrors it as an RNG gate (registry-driven
// chance dispatch is later infrastructure). 32768 = (0.5 * 65535).round()
// — half-up rounding, clamped under CHANCE_NONE_SENTINEL=0xFFFF.

ability Daze {
    target: enemy
    range: 5.0
    cooldown: 4s
    hint: crowd_control

    stun 1s chance 50% [CROWD_CONTROL: 100]
}
